Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.47,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Listen to the cactus snap… and a surprise inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:13.79,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Fact one: Cactus contains a gel used in cosmetic products.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.09,0:00:23.26,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Fact two: ASMR relies on soft repetitive sounds to trigger a relaxing brain response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:32.30,CapEN,,0,0,0,,And fact three: A shocking moment in the first seconds boosts average watch time noticeably.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:58.38,CapEN,,0,0,0,,And tonight's takeaway in three touches. For your mind: Curiosity pushes us to try odd things even when they look strange. For your heart: The surprise moment creates a binge feeling and pure fun. For your soul: Savor the calm before the shock and realize the experience can be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:04.69,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Subscribe to Daousha now and drop the next video you want to see in the comments!
